674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y_oct6P16I8Q7kNvwGttpX9&_nc_oc=Adq_7rNSErmxnSQxDf__1uZLbEQTZUpolr-eAXJd3G6BXWxdlnObWaTDeT9sBmd6s00&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD90NXESILzAd84E4dPtA2zn8xDMDTR9oHmQgcJ8u0I7A&oe=6A64C8D9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wJAdKvU-vB0Q7kNvwGv7c0B&_nc_oc=Ado65wC4QBsG_CajOZhwF62mIz0qmaedKg4En-Fx_tQ60-elmqUiOWnzvjiGJlFUDbo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAtk2LIZpFF936LdzGOatQzCHbIbCAfX_pWEuxhfhw9GA&oe=6A64D196"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ziYU5ccbukYQ7kNvwGBezYw&_nc_oc=Adp6vwpscF4xKzJ75gSW8y9q0OBnXgOpv2f2xll6gJIV2fn9Ha_uiTuaRA8WMxh5s4E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDgAcJJ7B3jL0Wqfd7KR-lO5F7EeHHPqIMxY422w2-VXQ&oe=6A64CDB1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip